# {{.Title}}

A [tifa](https://github.com/liustack/tifa) app.

```sh
go tool tifa dev     # run it at http://127.0.0.1:3000, rebuilding on every change
go test ./...        # test the Go code
pnpm typecheck       # check the TypeScript
go tool tifa build   # build the single executable into bin/
```

Pages and API routes live in `app/`: each folder is a URL. See [Writing an app](https://github.com/liustack/tifa/blob/main/docs/app.md).
